@startuml COMP-SEQ12
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ12 UC12 创作者数据分析（组件级）

actor "创作者" as Creator
participant "CreatorDashboardPage" as Page
participant "MetricLineChart" as Chart
participant "videoApi / Axios" as Api
participant "Gin Router / AuthMiddleware" as Router
participant "AnalyticsHandler" as Handler
database "MySQL\nvideos / creator_daily_stats / video_daily_stats" as DB

Creator -> Page: 打开创作中心
Page -> Api: creatorAnalytics(days, videoId?)
Api -> Router: GET /api/v1/creator/analytics + Bearer Token
Router -> Handler: AnalyticsHandler(context)
Handler -> Handler: 从登录上下文取得 creatorId 并校验 days
opt 指定 videoId
  Handler -> DB: 校验视频归属当前创作者
  DB --> Handler: 存在 / 不存在
end
Handler -> DB: 查询范围内创作者每日统计
opt 指定 videoId
  Handler -> DB: 查询作品每日统计
end
Handler -> Handler: 按自然日补零并计算范围汇总、日均值
Handler -> DB: 汇总累计播放/收藏、推流及前五作品
DB --> Handler: 汇总与排行记录
Handler --> Api: CreatorAnalytics / HTTP 400、404、500
Api --> Page: 更新分析状态
Page -> Chart: 传入播放、收藏和增长趋势点
Chart --> Creator: 展示指标卡、折线图和作品排行
@enduml
